{
  "schema": "research-public-artifact/v1",
  "concept": "Partition Field Count Limits (DATE vs CUSTOM)",
  "slug": "partition-field-count-limits-date-vs-custom",
  "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e54d1a78017601c13716b14bbcb25974ff6bc1a3f1b256e8f1c9d5f63c21a8c6",
  "canonical_artifact_sha256": "a13615bed7640489f19638760cc25f81cd26d593347bc0024ed1fbd30cd24922",
  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "clm:20f80b22584513e8c3d44587c33226c0ee09c58c58bee9b84b20623b83b6ac0b",
      "text": "When creating a DATE archive through the API or Terraform, include criteria.dateField (Terraform date_field) in the partition-field list. It consumes one of the three available slots. (high confidence) (verified as of 2024-11-13)",
      "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/api/doc/atlas-admin-api-v2/2024-11-13/operation/operation-getgroupclusteronlinearchive",
      "also": [
        "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/online-archive/configure-online-archive-standard.md",
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mongodb/terraform-provider-mongodbatlas/master/docs/resources/online_archive.md"
      ],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:3145ff56a1245c12e6e462a73b27a4c8b5c713f9b2ecc02a5db8aca4a93f56ef",
        "ev:5ceeda52f9ac47bbf34de8a4500e73202308fac9ca5cd2d35344e4c461e537b6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:04c1229672265e0b6780597ebaeb1e4f9d933c31522635954112dd080a7ceeb5",
      "text": "For criteria.type DATE, the documented maximum is three partition fields total, including the required archival date field; at most two other fields can be added. (high confidence) (verified as of 2024-11-13)",
      "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/api/doc/atlas-admin-api-v2/2024-11-13/operation/operation-getgroupclusteronlinearchive",
      "also": [
        "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/online-archive/configure-online-archive-standard.md",
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mongodb/terraform-provider-mongodbatlas/master/docs/resources/online_archive.md",
        "https://www.pulumi.com/registry/packages/mongodbatlas%403.x/api-docs/onlinearchive/"
      ],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:5ceeda52f9ac47bbf34de8a4500e73202308fac9ca5cd2d35344e4c461e537b6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:76ef78f525955be83579e444fca734b83e3b4c136a96d37310e92fbad6fb539b",
      "text": "For criteria.type CUSTOM, the documented maximum is two partition fields total. The DATE three-field allowance is conditional on DATE criteria, not a general allowance for every archive. (high confidence) (verified as of 2024-11-13)",
      "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/api/doc/atlas-admin-api-v2/2024-11-13/operation/operation-getgroupclusteronlinearchive",
      "also": [
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mongodb/terraform-provider-mongodbatlas/master/docs/resources/online_archive.md",
        "https://www.pulumi.com/registry/packages/mongodbatlas%403.x/api-docs/onlinearchive/"
      ],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:5ceeda52f9ac47bbf34de8a4500e73202308fac9ca5cd2d35344e4c461e537b6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:a1a9a60fe8bed52d64ff1f04095b1b56c087de88464d33eae609b92a7fcfb9c6",
      "text": "An Online Archive must have at least one partition field; the documented maxima are not a requirement to populate every available field slot. (high confidence) (verified as of 2024-11-13)",
      "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/api/doc/atlas-admin-api-v2/2024-11-13/operation/operation-getgroupclusteronlinearchive",
      "also": [
        "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/online-archive/configure-online-archive-standard.md"
      ],
